      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是我也能露出那样的笑容……\n孙子们也会高兴吧。\n再一次……我要再一次用这双脚走路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a743035d5c20e537c3baf8d653f29d30e9a77ced0b362fc7b5faad542be5039",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
