    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d0cd092b5cbd34b41ea1fd0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要努力，银也是能变成金的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "673b306a17b5735f9928ad13c349ec825e27cf5a878eeae83f5662967400ab37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4615e3f3d26f11ba14d115d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "确实存在着天生就继承黄金光芒的赛马娘，\n然而──",
      "source_fingerprint": "47dbec362805ed2b5350b48bcd486c95ba2a88d98a5dcf043741118a4c63d1ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3aa85d1b69590f4ffba5b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将白银反复地叠加在一起，\n就能散发出接近黄金的光芒。\n她在今天证明了这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29c89c0134b452455ceaa188c69145eeccc2c50c22f2178b975795c4ec7329db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54eab489b8d78ccce75b02e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但问题是在这之后──\n这次过于勉强后……\n不知会造成什么样的影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "124b3d04a8f77d908c252cf27d1ad159a5f347f8366698798bfa560912a6d41e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe67fc8ef9285d059520578",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100308.json",
      "json_path": [
