    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a81c6c8c7c73fd0667ac18d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好，情况允许的话，\n我下次也想跟飞鹰子一起跑呢。\n因为飞鹰子总是会带给我活力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f14f42c6fd1c5716e3c3ad7e3c2b48b51cbb5c5e0bd6667c1d11fc1d7d050e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb42714fa3670432f009fac8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再来是“二月S”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a73a94c62f02bb53a4acb1939c2ea44bd5276b3a2b6cae54e82a94db7d762197",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
