      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91b122dc4ad810d080ff2f58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时间迫在眉睫，若参加就是连续参赛。\n对现在的奇锐骏太严苛了。\n况且──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b8d6eae7dc3e592b72682436ed2837609a0c3b2441f00642dad5765e3fa654b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6a0b60151d3700a87cea32f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就参加五月的“柏纪念”好了",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cedbe02b9267f2132338f9cce5dec9094d548e54ada4d6a9c40b2c4f973d788",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40e21cd593852d39b30b0bd2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对醒目飞鹰来说也是连续参赛，\n所以不参赛的几率也很高。\n如果是这样，再下一场的GⅠ竞赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5d049b6db651a5a3b079fe3ea3ab50cfed28b94a7a141736b5c67ae31adb588",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100308.json",
      "json_path": [
